    <value>Sensors (found/rendered) - sensors found by LibreHardwareMonitor, and how many are actively drawn
Poll (current/aimed) - measured update rate against the rate set in Settings
Read - duration of one full sensor pass, close to the poll rate means no headroom left
LibreHardwareMonitorLib is the largest and most established hardware monitoring library for Windows</value>
